+# Internal HTTP Policy
+
+HTTPS is required for all communication, including traffic between internal hosts; no plaintext HTTP exceptions are permitted under any circumstance. This HTTPS-only policy was adopted to harden the project's security posture and explicitly reverses an earlier decision that had permitted plain HTTP for internal host communication.
